MODULE: BindingConvergesWriteToRetiredWal
TARGET: BindingConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a source write changes the current physical state but appends to the retired physical log
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
    /\ logs' = [logs EXCEPT ![alias] = Append(@, 1)]
--- REPLACE
    /\ logs' = [logs EXCEPT ![3 - alias] = Append(@, 1)]
--- END
